  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">BEHTRUWC - Second Phase                           2010/18806</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BEHTRUWC - Second Phase - NFE Mapping</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BEHTRUWC is the second phase of the NFE3/Basic Education for Hard to  Reach Urban Children project for working children ( 1997-2004)which   was supported by Sida. It is a GOB project for urban working children in the 6 Divisions of Bangladesh covering 166150 children for the     period 2005-2012. It is supported by the GOB, UNICEF, CIDA and Sida.  Sida and CIDA funds are channeled through UNICEF.</narrative>
